## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Jungle Tempo Core (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Brute Force Breastplate, Malefic Roar, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Brute Force Breastplate
- Emblem: Assassin Emblem with Rupture, Seasoned Hunter, Killing Spree
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when physical chip is the main threat and the enemy draft has limited hard crowd control.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Roar when Use against Estes, Rafaela, Floryn, Esmeralda, or heavy lifesteal cores when Lifebane is more urgent than armor penetration.; Blade of Despair over Brute Force Breastplate when Use when you are ahead and your team already has enough front-line control to let Leomord enter second.; Queen's Wings over Immortality when Use before the final revive-swap stage when burst damage is forcing you off the horse before the chase finishes.
- Total cost: 10860 gold

Default jungle setup for ranked games where Leomord needs War Axe plus Hunter Strike chase tempo, then Brute Force Breastplate to stay mobile through mounted skirmishes.

### Jungle Anti-Sustain Bruiser (Jungle)

- Items: Warrior Boots, War Axe, Sea Halberd, Endless Battle, Queen's Wings, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Sea Halberd, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Seasoned Hunter, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Ice Retribution
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when stuns, slows, or magic poke are the first things stopping the mounted path.; Malefic Roar over Endless Battle when Use when the enemy front line is stacking armor and your team still needs Leomord to damage the first body in the way.; Blade of Despair over Queen's Wings when Use when the enemy sustain is controlled and you need a stronger execute window on low-health carries.; Oracle over Immortality when Use with allied healing or shielding when repeated objective fights matter more than one late-game revive.
- Total cost: 11570 gold

Bruiser jungle setup for healing and shield drafts. Sea Halberd comes early so mounted area hits apply Lifebane before sustain supports can reset the fight.

### EXP Sprint Flex (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, War Axe, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle, Blade of Despair, Immortality
- Core: War Axe, Hunter Strike, Endless Battle
- Emblem: Fighter Emblem with Firmness, Festival of Blood, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use into physical EXP lanes when control is light and early lane damage is the real problem.; Brute Force Breastplate over Blade of Despair when Use when you must survive longer side-lane and river fights instead of playing for pure cleanup damage.; Sea Halberd over Endless Battle when Use against sustain EXP laners or healer drafts when anti-regen is needed before your damage spike is complete.; Malefic Roar over Blade of Despair when Use when armor stacking is preventing the mounted chase from forcing low-health executes.
- Total cost: 12270 gold

EXP flex setup for games where another jungler owns Retribution. Sprint preserves chase tempo outside the jungle while Fighter Emblem gives enough sustain to trade before mounting.

